<tr>
<td style="padding: 36px 40px 24px;">

    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">Dear {{first_name}},</p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">I am writing to ask whether {{organisation}} would share its published work with our network of electoral professionals.</p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">As funding for electoral bodies has been squeezed, we recognise that this can cause a knowledge gap for officials. Our members tell us they are working from whatever guidance they can find, and much of it is thin or out of date. The work {{organisation}} produces answers a good deal of what they are asking, but it rarely reaches them.</p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">ICPS is a convening partner of NOMOS, a professional network for electoral officials and public servants where members are verified by their own institution. Contributors know who they are reaching: the professionals in the ICPS Electoral Members&rsquo; Network, and the managers and polling staff below them.</p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;"><strong>How does it work?</strong> It costs nothing and asks nothing of your team. Published output can be fed through automatically. You can also write something specifically for our members. We run an editorial schedule across the year and would welcome pieces against it. ICPS contributes editorial on the same basis.</p>

    <!-- Clarification box -->
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 24px; background-color:#f0f4f8; border-radius:6px; border-left:4px solid #1a2744;">
    <tr><td style="padding: 18px 24px;">
        <p style="margin:0; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">NOMOS is not a marketplace and thought partners are not sponsors. The contribution is research and guidance rather than products or services.</p>
    </td></tr>
    </table>

    <p style="margin:0 0 24px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">Please reply and we will arrange a short call. If this is better directed to a colleague who looks after publishing or communications, please pass it on.</p>

